The mscx, MIDI and MusicXML files in this directory are copies of test
fixtures taken from the upstream MuseScore repository:

  https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore
  - Root fixtures (midi*, testArpeggio, testVolta*, …):
      src/importexport/midi/tests/midiexport_data/
  - musicxml/ subdirectory:
      src/importexport/musicxml/tests/data/

They are reproduced here to allow the swift-sheet-music test suite to
verify equivalence of its MIDI export against MuseScore's own exporter
output, and to exercise the MusicXML importer against MuseScore's own
MusicXML round-trip reference files.

These files are licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3
(GPL-3.0), the same licence as the upstream MuseScore source code:

  Copyright (C) 1999-2026 MuseScore Limited and others
  Licensed under GPL-3.0-only.

The full GPL-3.0 licence text is available at:
  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
  https://github.com/musescore/MuseScore/blob/master/LICENSE.txt

Note: these fixtures are confined to the test target of this Swift
package. They are not part of any of the published library products
(`SheetMusic`, `SheetMusicCore`, `SheetMusicMSCX`, `SheetMusicMIDI`) and
are not redistributed when the package is consumed via SwiftPM.

The midi01.mscz fixture is simply a ZIP-archived copy of midi01.mscx —
same GPL-3.0 provenance, no additional content. Produced with:

    zip -qX9 midi01.mscz score.mscx

where score.mscx is a byte-identical copy of midi01.mscx renamed to
the default MuseScore main-file name.

